  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WOCELIP - Child Rights (Education &amp; Empowerment)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to improving the situation of child rights regarding quality of secondary education, protection and participation through developing model schools, children&#x2019;s leadership skills and empowering adolescent girls to advocate against harmful social traditions and give information about SRHR hereunder HIV/AIDS.The project will advocate for implementation of integrated child protection policies and formal structures for child protection in rural municipalities.</narrative>
  </description>
